# (last on purpose: a later rule wins) gx10_budget.env matches the *.env secrets rule but holds only sizes (no secrets): it is the one
# budget every launcher sources, so it MUST be tracked (it was silently left out of the first commits).
!scripts/dgx/gx10_budget.env
